**File**: `pipeline/test_unified_edit_modal.py`

**Changes**:
- If any existing tests reference `#unified-edit-content` (the VerticalScroll id), update them to query widgets directly under `#unified-edit-dialog` instead.
- All existing behavioral tests (widget presence, _save() result, stage gating) should still pass since the field logic is unchanged.
- Run the full test suite to confirm no regressions.

**Dependencies**: Tasks 1-3

