### Summary of changes:
- **CSS only**: Remove VerticalScroll rule, remove dock:bottom, add overflow-y:auto to outer dialog
- **compose() only**: Remove VerticalScroll wrapper, de-indent fields one level
- **No logic changes**: _save(), handle_unified_edit, and all field-rendering conditionals remain identical
- **Risk**: Minimal — purely presentational fix matching the proven NewFeatureModal pattern
